// This course states no product or version facts, so there are no version notes. Time zones, clocks and holidays are taught as logistics to agree
// on and check with a converter, never as cultural verdicts. Every client, company and message is fictional. Every scenario and message task the
// activities name lives in src/features/practice/scenarios/clients/module-08.ts.

